    <td style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td>
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">criminal or civil liability, fines, damages or monetary
    penalties for violations of healthcare fraud and abuse laws, including the federal False Claims Act, CMPL, and AKS;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
