    <td style="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">the cost, efficacy, safety profile,
    convenience, ease of administration and other potential advantages compared to alternative treatments and therapies;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font-size: 10pt">
