    <td style="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td>
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">the willingness of patients to
