    disclaims beneficial ownership of all such shares held by Cytovia except to the extent of his pecuniary interest therein. Excludes
    6,530,759 shares of common stock under Series C-1 Preferred Shares subject to stockholder approval and beneficial ownership limitations.</span></td></tr>
